<title>USA: ADR REPORT - Latam ADRs fall on peso, politics.</title>
<headline>ADR REPORT - Latam ADRs fall on peso, politics.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latin American shares fell on Wednesday on worries about the Mexican peso and Argentine political concerns, traders said.</p>
<p>Luxury goods makers also saw share prices soften as American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) largely followed the New York markets lower.</p>
<p>One trader in Latin ADRs said, &quot;There is only bad news, and no news to be buying on. The whole market is focusing on the peso.&quot;</p>
</text>
